{"chunk_id": "5abdc7f0c537", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "中国氢能及燃料电池研究历程", "date_hint": "", "text": "中国的氢能与燃料电池研究始于上世纪50年代。20 世纪80年代以来，相继启动了863计划和973计划，加速以研究为基础的技术商业化项目，氢能和燃料电池均被纳入其中。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "5abdc7f0c537", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
