{"chunk_id": "2dc456d34cde", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "氢能及燃料电池产业链", "date_hint": "", "text": "在氢能及燃料电池的产业链上，氢燃料电池上游氢气制储运加环节规模化发展、电堆核心组件本土化批量化生产以及下游商用车辆应用等均是现阶段值得重点关注的重要环节。\n4.中国氢燃料电池行业市场规模及氢燃料电池汽车保有量发展目标", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "2dc456d34cde", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
