{"chunk_id": "bfaebedbddfb", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "氢能及燃料电池产业链", "date_hint": "", "text": "我国氢燃料电池行业发展迅速，市场自2015年以来实现较快增长。根据头豹研究院测算，到2024年中国氢燃料电池行业按装机量计算的市场规模达到1383MW，CAGR达61%。参照SAE《节能与新能源汽车技术路线图2.0》对氢燃料电池制定的发展规划，到2020/2025/2030年，氢燃料电池汽车的保有量将分别达到8000-10000辆/5万-10万辆规模/80万-100万辆，保有量规划有十年百倍的增长。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "bfaebedbddfb", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
