{"chunk_id": "ccfb851f18f8", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "国内氢燃料电池行业竞争格局", "date_hint": "", "text": "2019 年，国内氢燃料电池装机量前五分别为重塑（28.8%）、亿华通（17.9%）、清能股份（14.4%）、国鸿重塑（13.7%）和捷氢科技（12.6%）；2020 年，国内氢燃料电池装机量前五为爱德曼（20.1%）、亿华通（15.4%）、国鸿重塑（11.9%）、探索汽车（11.6%）、潍柴动力（10.0%），市场参与者增多，市场竞争加剧。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "ccfb851f18f8", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
